Write an algorithm in Java to reverse an array.?
public void reverse(int[] arr) {

  int low = 0;
  int high = arr.length-1;

  while (low < high) {
    int temp = arr[low];
    arr[low] = arr[high];
    arr[high] = temp;
    low++;
    high--;
  }
}

